  "description": "Experience the freedom to conquer any terrain with the Kutty X 2 folding electric bike. Powered by a robust 48V 500W motor, this compact yet powerful bike is designed to handle any challenge that comes your way. With its sleek low-step design and folding feature, the Kutty X 2 is the perfect companion for riders of all levels, especially when space is limited.\nFeatures:\n\nPowerful Motor: 48V 500W motor provides ample power to climb any hill.\n\nCompact Folding Design: Easily folds for convenient storage and transportation.\n\nSleek Low-Step Design: Makes it easy to get on and off the bike.\n\nVersatile Use: Ideal for commuting, running errands, or exploring new trails.\n\nBenefits:\n\nConquer any terrain with ease, thanks to the powerful motor.\nEnjoy the convenience of a compact folding design for easy storage and transportation.\nExperience effortless mounting and dismounting with the sleek low-step design.\nExplore new places and adventures with the versatile use of the Kutty X 2 folding electric bike.\n\nRediscover the joy of biking and make every journey an adventure with the Kutty X 2.",
